Here are a few examples to get you started:

```typescript
// Retrieve an avatar image by its hash and save it to a file.
const avatarHash = "some_avatar_hash";
const avatarData = await client.getAvatar({ avatarHash });

// Assuming avatarData is a Blob or similar binary data representation:
const blob = new Blob([avatarData], { type: 'image/png' }); // Adjust type if needed
const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);
const a = document.createElement('a');
a.href = url;
a.download = `avatar_${avatarHash}.png`;
document.body.appendChild(a);
a.click();
document.body.removeChild(a);
window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
```

